# The version the rebuilt Skiko jars are published under. It is not in pins.env on purpose: the Skia archives are cached by
# pins.env and the Skia patch, and a new version with the same sources must not rebuild Skia. Serenity's build.sbt takes the
# same version; see DEVELOPMENT.md.
NATIVES_VERSION=0.153.0-dngfree.2
